    {
      "kind": "title",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Q3 2026 Operations Review"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Northwind Logistics · Operations Analytics · October 2026"
        }
      ],
      "align": "center"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "1. Executive summary"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Third-quarter volume grew 8.4% year over year to 12.7 million parcels, and the cost per parcel fell for the fourth quarter in a row. Service improved in every region, although the Southwest remains below its on-time target."
        },
        {
          "text": "1",
          "sup": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "footnote",
      "label": "1",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All figures are unaudited and exclude the Freightline subsidiary acquired in August 2026."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "depth": 0,
          "marker": "•",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Volume:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " 12.7 million parcels, up 8.4% from Q3 2025"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "depth": 0,
          "marker": "•",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "On-time delivery:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " 96.1%, up from 94.8% in Q2"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "depth": 1,
          "marker": "o",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Northeast region: 97.3%, the best result since 2021"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "depth": 1,
          "marker": "o",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Southwest region: 94.2%, still below the 95% target"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "depth": 0,
          "marker": "•",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Cost per parcel:",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": " $3.42, down 2.6% from Q2"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "depth": 1,
          "marker": "o",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Fuel: down 4.1% on lower diesel prices"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "depth": 1,
          "marker": "o",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Labor: up 1.2% after the July wage adjustment"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The rest of this review covers regional results, costs, and the risks for the fourth quarter."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
